The PNG decoding transformations, the format-conversion reader and writer
(png/transform.hpp, png/simple.hpp, including the sRGB conversion tables)
and the chunk handling rules follow the behavior of libpng
(http://www.libpng.org/pub/png/libpng.html), reimplemented in C++ for vio.
The following notice applies to those parts.

